  "project_description": "This is a very simple module that allows you to create Hubspot form blocks on your Drupal sites. The module also comes with a new field type so each entity could have it's own form.\n\n Key Features \n No need to copy embed code from Hubspot and paste it into your website.\n\n \n Supports legacy API key. \n Display your own Hubspot Forms as blocks. \n Embed Hubspot forms into your content via CKEditor 4 or CKEditor 5 editors. \n \n Examples \n \n CKEditor 5: \n CKEditor 4 is no longer supported \n Back to top",
